  },
  {
    "id": "piraiba-live",
    "speciesId": "brachyplatystoma-filamentosum",
    "dimension": "bait",
    "text": "Bait for a piraíba is a whole fish, a big one, on a hook you could hang a coat on. They feed most at night.",
